OL,3,GNEWSA'I won Gladiators - now I'd love
OL,4,Ato become one'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHaving been bashed, bumped and bruised
OL,7,Fon his way to winning Gladiators
OL,8,Fearlier this year, you might expect
OL,9,FJosh McDonald wants to put his feet up.
OL,11,FBut the Glasgow fitness coach has not
OL,12,Fonly signed up for another go on the
OL,13,Ffamous Eliminator challenge - he
OL,14,Ffancies becoming one of the Lycra-clad
OL,15,Fstars.
OL,17,FThe 29-year-old triumphed in the third
OL,18,Fseason of the popular programme, which
OL,19,Fwas filmed in Sheffield last year.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
