OL,3,GNEWSA'I won Gladiators - now I'd love
OL,4,Ato become one'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe is now getting the chance to go
OL,7,Fagain on games like Duel, Gauntlet and
OL,8,FThe Wall as part of a live tour across
OL,9,Fthe country.
